\r\n\r\n<div class=\"curriculum-page-wrapper\">\r\n    <div class=\"unit-hero\">\r\n        <h1>BNS 112: <span class=\"unit-highlight\">Foundations of Nursing<\/span><\/h1>\r\n        <p>An introduction to the core concepts, theories, and philosophies that define professional nursing practice, from its historical evolution to the application of the nursing process.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"unit-content-section\">\r\n        <h2>Course Content<\/h2>\r\n        <p>Explore the detailed topics covered in Foundations of Nursing.<\/p>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"unit-container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"unit-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"unit-card-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"unit-icon-box badge-purple\"><i class=\"fas fa-book\"><\/i><\/div>\r\n                    <h3>History and Evolution of Nursing<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"unit-sub-section\">\r\n                    <ul class=\"unit-list\">\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Historical Perspectives<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Evolution as a Profession<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Influences of Human Development<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Global Perspectives<\/a><\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"unit-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"unit-card-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"unit-icon-box badge-blue\"><i class=\"fas fa-user-nurse\"><\/i><\/div>\r\n                    <h3>The Discipline of Nursing<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"unit-sub-section\">\r\n                    <ul class=\"unit-list\">\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Major Concepts & Principles<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Important Definitions<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Specialisations & Goals<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Roles of a Nurse<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Qualities of a Professional Nurse<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Patterns of Knowing<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Educational Preparation<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Professional Development<\/a><\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"unit-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"unit-card-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"unit-icon-box badge-green\"><i class=\"fas fa-comments\"><\/i><\/div>\r\n                    <h3>Therapeutic Interactions<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"unit-sub-section\">\r\n                    <ul class=\"unit-list\">\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Key Terms<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Nurse-Patient Relationships<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">The Communication Process<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Techniques of Communication<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Barriers to Communication<\/a><\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"unit-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"unit-card-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"unit-icon-box badge-orange\"><i class=\"fas fa-building\"><\/i><\/div>\r\n                    <h3>Nursing Organizations and Associations<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"unit-sub-section\">\r\n                    <ul class=\"unit-list\">\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Importance of Organizations<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Global & Regional Roles<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">National Roles<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Nursing Partners (MOH, WHO, etc.)<\/a><\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"unit-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"unit-card-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"unit-icon-box badge-pink\"><i class=\"fas fa-scale-balanced\"><\/i><\/div>\r\n                    <h3>Positioning Nursing as a Professional Discipline<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"unit-sub-section\">\r\n                    <ul class=\"unit-list\">\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Definitions: Profession, Discipline<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Characteristics of Professions<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Categorization of Professions<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Differentiating from Occupations<\/a><\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"unit-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"unit-card-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"unit-icon-box badge-purple\"><i class=\"fas fa-lightbulb\"><\/i><\/div>\r\n                    <h3>Philosophies of Nursing<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"unit-sub-section\">\r\n                    <ul class=\"unit-list\">\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Beliefs, Values & Philosophies<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Philosophy of Nursing in Uganda<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Developing Personal Philosophies<\/a><\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"unit-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"unit-card-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"unit-icon-box badge-blue\"><i class=\"fas fa-heart\"><\/i><\/div>\r\n                    <h3>The Individual, Health and Holism<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"unit-sub-section\">\r\n                    <ul class=\"unit-list\">\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Health, Illness & Wellness Models<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Holistic Approach<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Stress, Adaptation & Coping<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Loss, Grieving & Death<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Role in Health Promotion<\/a><\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"unit-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"unit-card-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"unit-icon-box badge-green\"><i class=\"fas fa-sitemap\"><\/i><\/div>\r\n                    <h3>Metaparadigm Concepts of Nursing<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"unit-sub-section\">\r\n                    <ul class=\"unit-list\">\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Key Concepts<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Metaparadigm: Nursing, Person, Environment, Health<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Application in Practice<\/a><\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"unit-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"unit-card-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"unit-icon-box badge-orange\"><i class=\"fas fa-book-open\"><\/i><\/div>\r\n                    <h3>Theory as a Basis for Professional Practice<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"unit-sub-section\">\r\n                    <ul class=\"unit-list\">\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Theory Types<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Selected Theorists<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Caring Paradigms<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Application to Practice & Research<\/a><\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"unit-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"unit-card-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"unit-icon-box badge-pink\"><i class=\"fas fa-clipboard-list\"><\/i><\/div>\r\n                    <h3>The Nursing Care Processes<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"unit-sub-section\">\r\n                    <ul class=\"unit-list\">\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Approaches to Nursing Care<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Components of the Nursing Process<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Advantages & Disadvantages<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\">Utilization of the Process<\/a><\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"unit-references-section\">\r\n        <h2>Key References<\/h2>\r\n        <p>A selection of key texts and resources cited in this course unit.<\/p>\r\n        <ol class=\"unit-references-list\">\r\n            <li>DeLaune, S.C., & Ladner, P.K., (2010). <strong>Fundamentals of Nursing<\/strong>: Delmar<\/li>\r\n            <li>Parker, M. (2005). <strong>Nursing Theories and Nursing Practice<\/strong>: F.A. Davis Company<\/li>\r\n            <li>Ellis, J., & Hartley, C. (2007). <strong>Nursing in Today's World<\/strong>: Lippincott Williams & Wilkins<\/li>\r\n            <li>Barnard, A., & Locsin, R.C. (2008) <strong>Technology and Nursing Practice: issues, concepts<\/strong>; Palgrave<\/li>\r\n            <li>Boykin, A., & Schoenhofer, S. (2000). <strong>Nursing as caring<\/strong>: Jones & Ballet<\/li>\r\n            <li>Griffith, R., & Tengnah, C. (2010). <strong>Law and Professional Issues in Nursing<\/strong>: Learning Matters.<\/li>\r\n        <\/ol>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-3657215 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"3657215\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_ha_eqh_enable&quot;:false}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-22f4d5d\" data-id=\"22f4d5d\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9b7dddb elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"9b7dddb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<script async src=\"https:\/\/pagead2.googlesyndication.com\/pagead\/js\/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-5767364969818632\"\r\n     crossorigin=\"anonymous\"><\/script>\r\n<!-- Display Ad Posts -->\r\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\"\r\n     style=\"display:block\"\r\n     data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5767364969818632\"\r\n     data-ad-slot=\"7570414357\"\r\n     data-ad-format=\"auto\"\r\n     data-full-width-responsive=\"true\"><\/ins>\r\n<script>\r\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\r\n<\/script>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>BNS 112: Foundations of Nursing An introduction to the core concepts, theories, and philosophies that define professional nursing practice, from its historical evolution to the application of the nursing proc